## Installation

<enhanced-code-block group display="tabs" bind:title={settings.packageManager}>

```bash title=npm
npm install --save-dev @svelte-put/clickoutside
```

```bash title=pnpm
pnpm add -D @svelte-put/clickoutside
```

```bash title=yarn
