## Deprecation Notice

This package has been dropped in favor of [@svelte-put/popover](/docs/popover). `@svelte-put/popover` is a more generic implementation that relies on [Popover API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Popover_API), which has landed in baseline in 2024 and provides better fallback for progressive enhancement in case Javascript is not available.

